Skill: Cross-Platform Icon Adaptation (Desktop to Mobile)
Overview
This skill provides a complete set of guidelines, design specifications, and implementation patterns to adapt UI icons between desktop and mobile devices seamlessly.
1. Dimensional & Touch Target Specifications
